  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c81ee6009639159674d83e91bea09cd011971c1475b7f43785db9afc2666f6d2",
      "text": "教养问答节目的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff8d8796989ac8061bebd0c3a4c47c2795acba3627aec507ab61577b1b9e4db",
      "text": "彩排时的幸广先生太厉害了！\n虽然只是模拟问题，但您答对了好几道呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40d2b1169ea94b5a7c1e9bd14c96ebd6de4561ae4b190212164a03fddf148aea",
      "text": "因为答题的舞台是我去过的国家嘛。\n而且题目大多挺简单的，纯属偶然啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ee43683245fd947db812bec8ae38e5116d5fe80eebc61b1bd95c6bc081734f0",
      "text": "说起来，幸广先生高中毕业后，\n环游过很多国家呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb13f2ae6e793821c9e2b4dea14a701bb366d984ac5d85bf5f095254b8ad3114",
      "text": "这次问答舞台所在的国家，是个什么样的地方呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e84ade924adda7ffc337351167c6c63d5adc280d2524cb050176e2ba8bd9052",
      "text": "气候很稳定，\n是一个住起来非常舒适的地方哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70aa6a963ac9c5e6ea1bdb170c1c6cbe9681405b014f5ad8b54be12158b01aed",
      "text": "我去过的那座城市，居民都很随和。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f616a44dea01042dd7edb0270064518e135a718bc39d0ca094a1121bb36a4554",
      "text": "又是请我吃饭，甚至在认识的当天\n就留我住在家里过夜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af691384cc9d85fde517410b967f3402b78feac1e2655bacbbe3e08d2bb57a42",
      "text": "真是一个好地方啊。\n我也真想哪天能去看看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a055795042ab5b8146eb223992d288de43283fac214563fb758c4baa5fd2abf",
      "text": "到那时候，我就把我推荐的去处告诉你。\n那可是只有当地人才知道的秘境哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_02:1_5_027_02:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbdefa806d8dfa30c52cddc1f14d15348567455bf4274b7878a0c1615f35a376",
      "text": "谢谢您。好期待啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
